. * getting the residuals by regressing x1 and x2 on Z
. 
. 
. 
. 
. 
. foreach exog of varlist `covars' `covars_miss' tm1-tm359 dat {
 31. 
. 
. 
. gen `exog'_x_hat_dem`i'=. 
